VERDICT: fix
- The amber "D1 is above its 20 mA rating — raise R1 or lower B1" warning is always visible, even with the switch open / I ≈ 14.3 mA: `.warn-note` sets `display:flex`, which overrides the UA `[hidden]{display:none}` rule, so the `hidden` property on `#overNote` does nothing (it shows in every screenshot).
- In the hit layer, B1's oversized transparent rect is painted after (on top of) its small `data-net="vcc"` / `data-net="MINUS"` probe rects, so clicks on the battery plates never probe those nets — they just clear the probe. Paint the big rect first instead.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>5 V switched LED with 200 R series resistor — interactive simulation</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#001A2B;
    --panel:#052B42;
    --wire:#C1C1FF;
    --hi:#DAFF33;
    --text:#FFFFFF;
    --muted:rgba(255,255,255,.58);
    --muted2:rgba(255,255,255,.78);
    --line:rgba(193,193,255,.14);
    --red:#FF6B5E;
    --red-soft:#FF8A7A;
    --green:#46E0A0;
    --green-soft:#8FE3B8;
    --amber:#FFC46B;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html,body{height:100%}
  body{
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;
    height:100vh;overflow:hidden;
  }
  /* ---------- top bar ---------- */
  .topbar{
    flex:0 0 58px;height:58px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    gap:14px;padding:0 18px;background:var(--panel);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;min-width:0}
  .logo{flex:0 0 auto}
  .brand h1{font-size:15px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.01em;white-space:nowrap}
  .brand p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:1px;white-space:nowrap}
  .mode-toggle{display:flex;gap:6px;background:rgba(0,26,43,.6);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:4px;border-radius:999px;flex:0 0 auto}
  .mode-toggle button{
    font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:650;color:var(--wire);
    background:transparent;border:none;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 18px;cursor:pointer;
    transition:background .15s ease,color .15s ease;
  }
  .mode-toggle button:hover{color:#fff}
  .mode-toggle button.active{background:var(--hi);color:#001A2B}
  /* ---------- layout ---------- */
  main{flex:1;display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px;min-height:0}
  .schematic-panel{
    flex:1.65;min-width:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  svg#schem{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
  .hint{
    position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
    font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted);background:rgba(0,26,43,.66);
    border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .status-chip{
    position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;
    color:var(--wire);background:rgba(0,26,43,.66);border:1px solid rgba(193,193,255,.3);
    padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;max-width:60%;
  }
  .status-chip.on{color:var(--hi);border-color:rgba(218,255,51,.45)}
  .status-chip.bad{color:var(--red-soft);border-color:rgba(255,107,94,.5)}
  /* ---------- side panel ---------- */
  .side{
    flex:0 0 352px;width:352px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;
    overflow-y:auto;min-height:0;padding-right:2px;
  }
  .card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px}
  .card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:9px}
  .card h2{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted2);letter-spacing:.02em}
  .pill{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;
    background:rgba(218,255,51,.1);color:var(--hi);border:1px solid rgba(218,255,51,.35)}
  .pill.done{background:rgba(70,224,160,.1);color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(70,224,160,.4)}
  /* mistakes */
  .mistakes ol{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
  .mistake{border-left:3px solid var(--red);padding:2px 0 2px 11px;font-size:11.3px;line-height:1.5}
  .mk-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;color:#FFB4A8;font-size:11.3px}
  .mk-num{flex:0 0 17px;width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);color:#26060A;
    font-size:10px;font-weight:800;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .mk-tag{margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--green);
    border:1px solid rgba(70,224,160,.45);border-radius:4px;padding:2px 6px;display:none}
  .mistake p{color:var(--muted2);margin:5px 0 4px}
  .mistake .fix{color:var(--green-soft)}
  .mistake .fix b{color:var(--green)}
  .mistakes.fixed .mistake{border-left-color:#2E7D5B;opacity:.82}
  .mistakes.fixed .mk-title{color:var(--green-soft)}
  .mistakes.fixed .mk-num{background:#2E7D5B;color:#D8FFE9}
  .mistakes.fixed .mk-tag{display:inline-block}
  /* controls */
  .ctl{margin:11px 0}
  .ctl-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted2)}
  .ctl-row output{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--hi);font-weight:700;font-size:12px}
  input[type=range]{width:100%;margin-top:7px;accent-color:var(--hi);cursor:pointer}
  .check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted2);margin-top:12px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
  .check input{accent-color:var(--hi);width:15px;height:15px;cursor:pointer}
  .note{font-size:10.3px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:9px;margin-top:11px}
  .warn-note{font-size:10.8px;color:var(--amber);margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
  .warn-note[hidden]{display:none}
  .warn-note::before{content:"";width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--amber);flex:0 0 8px}
  /* burnt card */
  .burnt{border-color:rgba(255,107,94,.5);background:#23111A}
  .burnt h2{color:#FFB4A8}
  .burnt p{font-size:11.3px;line-height:1.55;color:#FFD3CC;margin:2px 0 10px}
  .burnt button{font-family:inherit;background:var(--hi);color:#001A2B;border:none;border-radius:8px;
    padding:8px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
  .burnt button:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
  /* readings */
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11.3px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  th{text-align:left;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.09em;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;
     padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  td{padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(193,193,255,.08)}
  tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
  td.dim{color:var(--muted)}
  /* svg pieces */
  svg text{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}
  .wire{stroke:var(--wire);stroke-width:3;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;transition:stroke .15s ease}
  .wire.hi{stroke:var(--hi);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(218,255,51,.55))}
  .hitwire{stroke:rgba(0,0,0,0);stroke-width:22;fill:none;cursor:pointer}
  .lead{stroke:var(--wire);stroke-width:3}
  .plate-plus{stroke:var(--wire);stroke-width:3.4}
  .plate-minus{stroke:var(--wire);stroke-width:6}
  .plabel{font-size:15px;fill:rgba(255,255,255,.9)}
  .sublabel{font-size:11.5px;fill:var(--muted)}
  .contact{fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--wire);stroke-width:2.4}
  .pivot{fill:var(--wire)}
  .lever{stroke:var(--wire);stroke-width:4;stroke-linecap:round;transition:transform .18s ease}
  .lever.closed{stroke:var(--hi)}
  .part-hit{fill:rgba(0,0,0,0);cursor:pointer}
  .anno-red{fill:var(--red-soft);font-size:13px}
  .anno-green{fill:var(--green);font-size:13px}
  .anno-box{fill:rgba(255,107,94,.06);stroke:var(--red);stroke-width:1.8;stroke-dasharray:7 5}
  .anno-x{stroke:var(--red);stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round}
  .dots circle{fill:var(--hi)}
  /* floating overlays */
  .probe-badge{
    position:absolute;z-index:6;background:#0B3A57;border:1px solid var(--hi);color:var(--hi);
    font-size:12px;font-weight:650;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 30px 8px 11px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.45);pointer-events:auto;max-width:280px;line-height:1.4
  }
  .probe-badge button{position:absolute;right:5px;top:4px;background:none;border:none;color:var(--hi);
    font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;padding:2px 4px}
  .tooltip{
    position:absolute;z-index:7;pointer-events:none;background:#0B3A57;border:1px solid rgba(193,193,255,.4);
    border-radius:8px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted2);
    box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.45);max-width:240px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums
  }
  .tooltip b{color:var(--hi);font-size:11px}
  /* responsive */
  @media (max-width: 920px){
    body{height:auto;overflow:auto}
    main{flex-direction:column;min-height:0}
    .schematic-panel{min-height:330px;flex:none;height:56vw;max-height:420px}
    .side{flex:none;width:100%;overflow:visible}
    .brand p{display:none}
    .brand h1{font-size:13px;white-space:normal}
    .hint{white-space:normal;text-align:center;max-width:92%;font-size:10px}
    .status-chip{max-width:88%}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">
    <svg class="logo" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true">
      <rect x="1" y="1" width="28" height="28" rx="7" fill="#001A2B" stroke="#C1C1FF" stroke-opacity=".35"/>
      <polygon points="9,11 9,19 16,15" fill="none" stroke="#DAFF33" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <line x1="18" y1="11" x2="18" y2="19" stroke="#DAFF33" stroke-width="1.6"/>
      <line x1="6" y1="15" x2="9" y2="15" stroke="#C1C1FF" stroke-width="1.4"/>
      <line x1="18" y1="15" x2="24" y2="15" stroke="#C1C1FF" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    </svg>
    <div>
      <h1>5 V switched LED with 200 R series resistor</h1>
      <p>Interactive schematic — solve the sketch, then fix it</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mode-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Circuit view">
    <button id="btnDrawn" aria-pressed="false">As drawn</button>
    <button id="btnFixed" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Fixed</button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <!-- ================= schematic ================= -->
  <section class="schematic-panel" id="schemPanel" aria-label="Schematic">
    <svg id="schem" viewBox="0 0 1000 360" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" role="img" aria-label="Circuit schematic">
      <defs>
        <radialGradient id="glowGrad" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
          <stop offset="0%"  stop-color="#FFE9A8" stop-opacity=".95"/>
          <stop offset="35%" stop-color="#FF9B3D" stop-opacity=".55"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#FF9B3D" stop-opacity="0"/>
        </radialGradient>
        <pattern id="gridDots" width="25" height="25" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <circle cx="1.2" cy="1.2" r="1.2" fill="rgba(193,193,255,.08)"/>
        </pattern>
      </defs>

      <rect x="0" y="0" width="1000" height="360" fill="url(#gridDots)"/>
      <g id="wireLayer"></g>

      <!-- ===== battery B1 ===== -->
      <g id="partB1">
        <line x1="130" y1="96" x2="170" y2="96" class="plate-minus"/>
        <line x1="106" y1="110" x2="194" y2="110" class="plate-plus"/>
        <text x="206" y="100" class="plabel">B1</text>
        <text x="206" y="117" class="sublabel" id="b1Val">5 V</text>
      </g>

      <!-- ===== LED D1 ===== -->
      <g id="partD1">
        <circle id="ledGlow" cx="475" cy="220" r="34" fill="url(#glowGrad)" opacity="0"/>
        <line x1="452" y1="220" x2="458" y2="220" class="lead"/>
        <line x1="496" y1="220" x2="540" y2="220" class="lead"/>
        <polygon id="ledBody" points="458,204 458,236 490,220"
                 fill="#4A342F" stroke="#C1C1FF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <line x1="496" y1="203" x2="496" y2="237" class="lead" style="stroke-width:3.6"/>
        <g id="ledArrows" stroke="#FFD98A" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".3">
          <line x1="465" y1="201" x2="474" y2="190"/>
          <line x1="474" y1="190" x2="469.5" y2="191.5"/>
          <line x1="474" y1="190" x2="472.2" y2="195"/>
          <line x1="477" y1="205" x2="486" y2="194"/>
          <line x1="486" y1="194" x2="481.5" y2="195.5"/>
          <line x1="486" y1="194" x2="484.2" y2="199"/>
        </g>
        <g id="ledCrack" style="display:none" stroke="#C9D2DC" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
          <polyline points="462,212 470,221 476,210 484,226"/>
          <line x1="466" y1="204" x2="462" y2="196"/>
          <line x1="483" y1="232" x2="489" y2="240"/>
        </g>
        <text x="475" y="174" class="plabel" text-anchor="middle">D1 · LED</text>
      </g>

      <!-- ===== resistor R1 ===== -->
      <g id="partR1">
        <polyline points="620,220 632,220 638,207 650,233 662,207 674,233 686,207 698,233 705,220 712,220"
                  fill="none" stroke="#C1C1FF" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <text x="666" y="258" class="plabel" text-anchor="middle" id="r1Label">R1 · 200 Ω</text>
      </g>

      <!-- ===== switch S1 (fixed: SPST) ===== -->
      <g id="swFixed">
        <circle cx="296" cy="220" r="5.2" class="contact"/>
        <circle cx="352" cy="220" r="5.2" class="contact"/>
        <circle cx="296" cy="220" r="2.1" class="pivot"/>
        <line id="leverFixed" class="lever" x1="296" y1="220" x2="346" y2="220"
              style="transform-origin:296px 220px;transform:rotate(-28deg)"/>
      </g>
      <!-- ===== switch S1 (as drawn: changeover with grounded lower throw) ===== -->
      <g id="swDrawn" style="display:none">
        <circle cx="296" cy="174" r="5.2" class="contact"/>
        <circle cx="296" cy="258" r="5.2" class="contact"/>
        <circle cx="352" cy="220" r="5.2" class="contact"/>
        <circle cx="352" cy="220" r="2.1" class="pivot"/>
        <line id="leverDrawn" class="lever" x1="352" y1="220" x2="303" y2="183"
              style="transform-origin:352px 220px;transform:rotate(24deg)"/>
      </g>
      <text x="366" y="200" class="plabel">S1</text>
      <text x="366" y="215" class="sublabel">switch</text>

      <!-- ===== grounds ===== -->
      <g id="partG1">
        <line x1="168" y1="300" x2="168" y2="311" class="lead"/>
        <line x1="148" y1="311" x2="188" y2="311" class="lead"/>
        <line x1="156" y1="319" x2="180" y2="319" class="lead" style="stroke-width:2.4"/>
        <line x1="163" y1="327" x2="173" y2="327" class="lead" style="stroke-width:2"/>
        <text x="198" y="322" class="sublabel">G1</text>
      </g>
      <g id="partG2">
        <line x1="858" y1="262" x2="858" y2="273" class="lead"/>
        <line x1="838" y1="273" x2="878" y2="273" class="lead"/>
        <line x1="846" y1="281" x2="870" y2="281" class="lead" style="stroke-width:2.4"/>
        <line x1="853" y1="289" x2="863" y2="289" class="lead" style="stroke-width:2"/>
        <text x="832" y="284" class="sublabel" text-anchor="end">G2</text>
      </g>

      <!-- ===== annotations: as drawn ===== -->
      <g id="annoDrawn">
        <circle cx="150" cy="74" r="6.6" fill="none" stroke="#FF6B5E" stroke-width="2.4"/>
        <line x1="145.3" y1="69.3" x2="154.7" y2="78.7" class="anno-x"/>
        <line x1="154.7" y1="69.3" x2="145.3" y2="78.7" class="anno-x"/>
        <text x="166" y="66" class="anno-red">Floating minus — no return path</text>
        <rect x="230" y="238" width="88" height="68" rx="9" class="anno-box"/>
        <text x="274" y="334" class="anno-red" text-anchor="middle">Grounded lower throw — mis-drawn</text>
